3. Requirements evidence that grants no rights
----------------------------------------------

A second source was read while building this repository: the `craft-skills`
repository (https://github.com/Xia-Ataraxia/craft-skills) at revision
836eb8778134d68f3ea675cd30ee5f9ae692f9e3, read-only, as behavioural and
requirements evidence for what the nine features must do.

That revision contains no `LICENSE`, `COPYING`, or `NOTICE` file. Its only
licence statement is the string `MIT` in two plugin manifests, and its own README
states that MIT is declared in the plugin manifest with no licence file present.
A declaration without the copyright line and permission text is not a notice this
repository can honour or pass on. Accordingly:

- No code, prose, table, checklist, example, asset, or corpus string from that
  source is copied into or redistributed by this repository.
- Every behaviour adopted from it was re-expressed from the underlying
  requirement and grounded in public vendor documentation, which each package
  cites in its own Git history.

That source's own changelog claims a further third-party lineage for material
that predates it, also without a licence notice. Since no expression from it is
reproduced here, no rights over that third-party material are claimed, granted,
or implied by this repository.


